{"id":"5c3d3fd9c681563f","group":"28","path":"28/28-cor-np-neq-nexp.md","title":"NP严格包含于NEXP","display":"cor-np-neq-nexp — NP严格包含于NEXP","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-cor-np-neq-nexp","aliases":["28-cor-np-neq-nexp"],"display":"cor-np-neq-nexp — NP严格包含于NEXP","depends_on":["[[28-df-np]]","[[28-df-nexp]]","[[28-df-ntime]]","[[28-thm-nondeterministic-time-hierarchy]]"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach; §3.2 Theorem 3.2; local consequence","source_printed_pages":"69–70","source_pdf_pages":"95–96","source_status":"statement-compared-proof-not-fully-reviewed","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-cor-np-neq-nexp"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-cor-np-neq-nexp</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-np-neq-nexp — NP严格包含于NEXP"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0cb5248561455df8\" href=\"?note=0cb5248561455df8\" title=\"28-df-np\">28-df-np</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"75ba006af50075ad\" href=\"?note=75ba006af50075ad\" title=\"28-df-nexp\">28-df-nexp</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7514d356710d2e51\" href=\"?note=7514d356710d2e51\" title=\"28-df-ntime\">28-df-ntime</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"645e23d166674b47\" href=\"?note=645e23d166674b47\" title=\"28-thm-nondeterministic-time-hierarchy\">28-thm-nondeterministic-time-hierarchy</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach; §3.2 Theorem 3.2; local consequence"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"69–70"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"95–96"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-proof-not-fully-reviewed"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{NP},\\mathbf{NEXP},\\mathrm{NTIME}\">\\(\\mathbf{NP},\\mathbf{NEXP},\\mathrm{NTIME}\\)</span> 见所列本地定义；层级结论采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"645e23d166674b47\" href=\"?note=645e23d166674b47\" title=\"28-thm-nondeterministic-time-hierarchy\">28-thm-nondeterministic-time-hierarchy</a> 的证据边界。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{NP}\\subsetneq\\mathbf{NEXP}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf{NP}\\subsetneq\\mathbf{NEXP}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>取f(n)=(n+2)<sup>{\\lceil\\log_2(n+2)\\rceil}和g(n)=2</sup>{n+2}，可构造性由按二进制计数实现，f(n+1)=o(g(n))。NP的每个固定次数多项式时间类包含于NTIME(f)，而层级定理给出NTIME(g)中不在NTIME(f)的语言；NTIME(g)⊆NEXP。该推导依赖尚未全面复核的一般非确定型层级定理，证据限制随之保留。</p>\n<p>来源：用户所给 Arora–Barak PDF，§3.2 Theorem 3.2; local consequence；印刷 pp.69–70 / PDF pp.95–96。本次核对范围：对应陈述；证明边界见本节，未升级为完整证明核验。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-np","status":"resolved","id":"0cb5248561455df8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-np]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-nexp","status":"resolved","id":"75ba006af50075ad","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-nexp]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-ntime","status":"resolved","id":"7514d356710d2e51","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-ntime]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-thm-nondeterministic-time-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"645e23d166674b47","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-thm-nondeterministic-time-hierarchy]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-thm-nondeterministic-time-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"645e23d166674b47","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbf{NP},\\mathbf{NEXP},\\mathrm{NTIME}$ 见所列本地定义；层级结论采用 [[28-thm-nondeterministic-time-hierarchy]] 的证据边界。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbf{NP},\\mathbf{NEXP},\\mathrm{NTIME}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{NP}\\subsetneq\\mathbf{NEXP}.","display":true}],"bytes":1521,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-282","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-thm-nondeterministic-time-hierarchy]]、[[28-cor-np-neq-nexp]]、[[28-df-expcom-oracle]]、[[28-prop-expcom-oracle-collapse]]。"}],"outgoing":["0cb5248561455df8","75ba006af50075ad","7514d356710d2e51","645e23d166674b47"]}